<title>FRANCE: Bouygues Offshore H1 sales rise 25.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Bouygues Offshore H1 sales rise 25.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				2,279    vs    1,815</p>
<p>     New orders			    2,569    vs    2,446</p>
<p>     Backlog				 3,570    vs    3,410</p>
<p>	 Second quarter</p>
<p>	 Turnover			    1,330    vs	900</p>
<p>	 New orders			  2,162    vs    1,008</p>
<p>	 Backlog			     3,570    vs    3,410</p>
<p>NOTE - Bouygues Offshore gave its sales figures in a statement.</p>
<p>It said revenues rose 25.6 percent. The 1997 revenues include 74 million francs from the Nigerian Nissco subsidiary consolidated on January 1, 1997 and not reflected in the comparable 1996 period. Bouygues Offshore is a unit of French construction group Bouygues</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
